Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:11.01,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:17.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:23.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:29.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:46.49,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:53.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:01:00.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:05.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:12.48,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:23.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正当我们到处打探奈落的行踪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上遇见了三只小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这三只猴子又聒噪又冒失
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这些可爱的小猴子正在到处寻找的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们负责守护的猿神大爷的神体石像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而最后在村子的腌菜缸里面找到了猿神大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说出了一段令人惊讶的一段话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他曾经感觉到一股强烈的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝丑寅方向飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了 那一定是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丑寅方向… 是指东北方向吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子已经知道接下来该往哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是丑寅方向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:23.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第89话 他和他之间的探病大战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明早就该上路了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果现在是什么状况啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你别那么任性啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是戈薇自己喜欢感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我又不是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的对大家很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有耽误到大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正马上又要开始旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家也需要一点时间准备准备呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去打理一些道具才行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子戈薇这场病来得还真是时候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:03.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万不要放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.44,0:03:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赶快把病养好怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道你很心急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不要再责怪戈薇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又没有责怪她的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.23,0:03:23.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果戈薇要安心养病的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好还是避开犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏枫姥姥又不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧得很厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要回家休息几天呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们那边应该有很好的医生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说还有各式各样的药呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我还是回家休养
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛跟我们这么客气呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 我来背你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在打什么主意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.71,0:04:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天还要再请一天病假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次只是小小的感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮戈薇同学今天又请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次好像是感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是感冒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？没胃口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 我去煮点热饮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:35.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你配着药吃下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:40.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久戈薇都没回来过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么一回来就感冒了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概那边的天气比较冷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得好好休养几天才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.55,0:04:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小小的感冒也要请假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她以前不是老用一些罕见的病请假吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说要不要一起去看她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去探病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇这次既然是感冒 应该会在家休息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要住院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:09.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没有见到戈薇了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真的有点想她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去日暮同学家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说戈薇突然感冒了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感冒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要跟我们一起去… 是吗？得了感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底要不要跟我们去探病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪里怪气的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别乱了方寸 利吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇静一点就可以解决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实在的 好久都没打过妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:42.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为犬夜叉他们不在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要加倍努力才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.67,0:05:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快射箭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你碍到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 是你啊枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说 最近有很多妖怪出来作怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里面的人 被袭击得怕得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是因为奈落突然躲起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:27.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前奈落在这些妖怪都乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下还不趁机会出来作乱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:36.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活得不耐烦啦 死妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.57,0:06:52.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是特地赶来帮我们的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他根本没想那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挡着我 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 知不知道本大爷是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.19,0:07:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管你是谁都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子今天有事 一定要进这个泥沼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个泥沼已经是我的势力范围了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再敢罗罗唆唆 我的脑袋会吃掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用脑袋吃掉我是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有本事吃吃看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个山谷全都是我的势力范围
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个瀑布…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你聋了是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪一直都没再出现耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底躲到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在那边干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来了就顺便嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:39.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们来看我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在发烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鼻子跟喉咙觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一点点咳嗽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你的一点点小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算一点小感冒也不能够太大意喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得你最近为什么这么常生病呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 那个他有没有过来看你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装了 那个像太保的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.03,0:09:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会来看我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他果然一点也不体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在是什么情况嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你快点医好它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他是住远了一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远了一点是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个叫北条同学来看你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学 你怎么也来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一听说你感冒就想要来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过我一直很烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底我能够为你做些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想到可以送你能够帮助恢复健康的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不嫌弃的话 这些是送你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:52.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是可以保佑你身体健康的护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过仔细想想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:57.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还其实这些都出自于你们家神社呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们家的那些护身符一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是哑铃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你最好多做一点运动锻炼体力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢…谢谢你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先请进来坐再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:24.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.95,0:10:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇回家养病啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:28.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想在家里应该比较适合养病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就叫她回去养病了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不说一声就这样跑回去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个浑帐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我好不容易…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.86,0:10:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.73,0:10:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你把我扔在这里 一个人跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:46.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.15,0:10:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是名产吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.65,0:11:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 马上要出远门了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是准备路上吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明记得收在这里头的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:15.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到啦找到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是我们日暮家代代相传
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以治百病的灵丹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 爷爷 有了这瓶药
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信过了不久之后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇一定可以完全好起来的 算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蚋让开 太好了…找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:43.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 闯出大祸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好一点了没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐她一直在睡觉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有好多人来看她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:11:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些男生都好大一阵骚动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪亚由美太有魅力了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说这些了啦 绘理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们班那些男生好像也常在讨论耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些臭男生也会在背后说我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我想出去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真的追来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么追来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然追到戈薇家来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:31.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来探病的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好体贴哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么说啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然他什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.68,0:12:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇已经有男朋友的事都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 听说戈薇的男朋友很体贴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在在说的是我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.73,0:12:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢 我们说的是戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 戈薇已经有个在交往的男朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 不过连戈薇生病都没来看她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:12:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个很过分的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学校… 大家感觉起来很快乐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:08.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 什么事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗哥哥来看你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.39,0:13:15.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:17.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊 想看看你现在怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来探我的病啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫七宝跟珊瑚他们两个紧张兮兮的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我还有谁能来看你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的已经好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是还有一点点在发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身好像也没什么力气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别以为我是来带你回去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也认为你应该好好休养
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在能回家休养最好不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊咧 已经走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学 你有没有什么烦恼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦恼？你是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:11.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意当你的忠实听众
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者应该说 我希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管什么事你都可以跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽我最大的努力帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以换句话说 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能够交往的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会…啊咧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:37.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们猜这题会不会考啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:38.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要学力测验啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,学力测验？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这次考试结果是升学的参考指标呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,升学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有来上课的这段期间 有没有学习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没怎么学习…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真受不你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连明天会不会来上学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐… 能告诉我出题的范围是什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在生病不会想来考试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然要考了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日暮同学 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北条同学 你帮帮我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是有什么烦恼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮我恶补好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑不撑得住啊这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都没有休息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然科这个部分 它的范围已经很明确了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:43.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要把公式背好就行…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不要死撑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续吧 北条同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天真的很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们帮了我这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.79,0:16:08.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.43,0:16:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个什么学校考试的 真有那么重要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话又说回来 你感冒又没好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个什么鬼考试管他去的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.95,0:16:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为感冒好了要回学校
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不用功的话就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是先把感冒治好比较要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两样都同样重要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说你现在赶快乖乖上床睡觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:39.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想回学校嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点出去啦 不要妨碍我学习
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 现在觉得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈煮了一点稀饭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吃一点好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每样看起来都好好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个拿到外面去卖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以赚不少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.76,0:17:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我劝你们两个最好不要乱碰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没拿 什么都没碰过哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:31.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 头痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥你不是走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想借用一下你们家的炉灶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:54.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炉灶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:55.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用瓦斯炉行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要补充营养就得靠 肝脏 肝脏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狮子肝 鲤鱼肝 鸡肝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上做药引用的草还有树根
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:15.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬哥哥 你要吃这些东西哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:19.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.36,0:18:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呐 这是药
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.57,0:18:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点喝下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,药？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好臭哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝下去包管你百病全消
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么感冒一定马上就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真难喝…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忍耐一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道不是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是保证功效如神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个药是你自己熬的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:18:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能够治得好病
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种怪味道我还能够忍受啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这个药真的有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:13.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿 咿…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:18.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐把肝脏汤喝下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肝脏汤…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶 好像真的有效
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没骗你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没什么大不了的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你居然还知道这种配药处方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我老妈教的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈做给你吃过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 材料有点不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老妈用的 是放了很久的干货
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是生鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:19:58.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生鲜的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总…总之效果很棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说不需要那么客气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚对不起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说没关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也赶快睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你念的是不是什么咒语啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是很久以前我老妈教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:21:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身都舒服多了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你的药很有效喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就跟你说过会有效的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然好多了 那我就可以去上学了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要考试我也不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.01,0:21:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了 完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候出门一定会迟到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕连考试都赶不上了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:22.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点走 一定来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你叫我快一点也…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去换衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.26,0:21:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想要赶上考试的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家早
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.31,0:21:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感冒已经好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的睡了一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在好像全都好了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试准备得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我尽全力就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是要这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:18.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.31,0:22:28.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:37.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:47.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:52.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.07,0:22:57.57,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.85,0:23:05.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:11.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.63,0:23:15.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.36,0:23:23.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:33.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.40,0:23:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 狗哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问你一个男人之间的重大秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.37,0:23:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么是恋爱 噗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱就是永远吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛无缘无故问我这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷偷喜欢上小瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.68,0:24:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这件事让你去解决
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个可爱的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:05.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么样都会想出办法来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太大胆的爱情告白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题 简直比打妖怪还要棘手嘛
